  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, paprika, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the lamb pieces to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the lamb pieces onto skewers, leaving a little space between each piece.",
    "Brush the kebabs with olive oil and season with salt and black pepper.",
    "Grill the kebabs for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked to your liking.",
    "Transfer the kebabs to a plate and sprinkle with oregano.",
